{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"The City (Manhattan)","id":"851227479112548382","name":"coppers-sandwiches-🥪","position":50,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"You and me both.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:56:36.675000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870560496825270303","reply_to_id":"870560341577302037","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"All on my own??\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:56:45.878000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870560535425474570","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"When did I ever go all on my fucking own?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:56:59.734000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870560593541750814","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"Yes! Is that not what you said in the grove? That you wanted to free the ravens yourself! *So I didn't have to?*\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:57:13.022000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870560649275650058","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"Well, guess what, this is not an epic legend, jerkwad. You are not the main character. We are living in a war, and you would rather play a foolhardy hero than let other people do what they're supposed to. Gods forbid even *help us* do it!\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:57:27.870000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870560711552667659","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"Oh, was it a bad thing I wanted to save you guys the trouble of fighting a dragon? And remember, I was asked to go there, by *you*.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:57:55.043000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870560825524486154","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"We asked you to contact the ravens so we can prepare for the journey. No one said you take up arms and do someone else's job!\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:58:16.976000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870560917518159872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"I have tried to tell you, so many times, and it has never, *never* stuck in your head. You can never do anything on your own. I have lived hundreds of years, I know a thing or two. And that is something that's always been true.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:58:48.981000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-30T07:57:30.321000Z","id":"870561051756879935","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"Help you do it? How can I have helped you meet with that monster. The best help I could've done was to not make you guys go there. Look at that, all of you are different now. The lamplighters, unrecognizable, Willow silent.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:58:55.357000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870561078499754035","reply_to_id":"870560711552667659","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"You think there was any way out of Nidhogg's realm where you wouldn't have lost anything. Look at you know, finally happy with your old body back but here trapped in feathers.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:59:40.345000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870561267193114715","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"She bends down to your height, and Orphy echoes all her words.\n\n\"Do you think this hurts me, Speaker?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:00:01.934000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870561357743947828","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"Epic legend? Hero? I've done all I did for *you*.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:00:07.566000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870561381366251540","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"I am the master of loss. I had nothing before. I can always go back to nothing. My body just carries my soul. It can change as many times as it wants to.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:00:26.370000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-30T07:58:56.750000Z","id":"870561460235935774","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"Well then excuse me for trying. Excuse me for trying to keep it the way things were, when we were happy and having fun.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:01:19.052000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870561681200271370","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"And I don't want it. It sickens me, that you would do this and think you were doing it for me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:01:37.724000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870561759516327936","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"It sickens me that I did all of that as well. It sickens me that we ever decided to form a crew. If time would allow, I would go back to the day we met and walk away.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:02:40.650000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870562023447081020","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"That can happen, Speaker. It would be no loss to me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:03:02.514000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870562115151360040","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"Of course it wouldn't, o great master of loss.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:03:20.077000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870562188815917118","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"People disappear to me every day, and come back to life when I see them again. It hurts me none. In fact, it would be a gain to forget you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:03:34.084000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870562247565520917","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"I hate this. I hate being angry, but that's all I am when I see you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:03:43.805000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870562288338345984","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"The Speaker grows silent at this.","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:03:55.306000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870562336577044491","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"You think this is about the dragon? It's everything. Always, *always*, you think life is something you have to struggle with alone.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:04:41.226000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870562529179496468","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"If you want to have that, you will.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:04:49.944000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870562565745414155","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Avrae","id":"261302296103747584","is_bot":1,"username":"Avrae"},"author_id":"261302296103747584","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:05:09.642000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870562648364843048","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"So what now? You want to *forget*?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:05:15.721000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870562673862004756","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"Run away to your ravens then!\" The Speaker shouts to nowhere in particular. \"That's what you do best right? You ran away as Seraxa now you run away as Irynx.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:05:56.229000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870562843764879420","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"You hear the sound of beating wings, as she does indeed run.","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:06:10.843000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870562905060417546","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"You tell me that I shouldn't be alone but leave me anyway.\" At this statement the Speaker finally cracks and tears start streaming from his eyes. He runs from the sandwhich shop as well, tears coating his red scales.","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:06:55.850000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870563093833461760","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
